{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1511223-puzzled-about-extinguish-vitae","id":1511223,"title":"Puzzled about Extinguish Vitae","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-10T08:25:43-07:00","id":1511223,"title":"Puzzled about Extinguish Vitae","content":"Extinguish Vitae puzzles me a little.<br /> Where's the meaning of boosting a vampire's Hunger? I mean, a hungry foe isn't supposed to become even more dangerous to you?<br /> Why would you want to have an even angrier enemy? Maybe I'm missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T08:37:13-07:00","id":1511225,"title":"","content":"Well it is blood sorcery, it not requires a touch, the other don't even have to know you are there<br /> Of course not in an Elysium, but let's say soemwhere where it would be very... inconvenient to suddenly become <i>very</i> hungry<br /> A hungry vampire is dangerous, especially if it leads to a hunger-frenzy<br /> A hungry vampire can't really concentrate anything else than to feed - well it can, obviously, but with effort<br /> Not to mention a hungry vampire is while dangerous to you, more dangerous to its allies or anyone else near<br /> It is more like a delicate political an power tool; making circumstances where you can swoop in and &quot;help out&quot; your hungry fellow, cashing in some nice boons<br /> &quot;Dear boy, you really made a mess, it was lucky I was nearby and you not made a bigger mess, god forbid, kill someone! It is a small thing, I know... well not that small, but don't worry, I'm sure when I will need <b>your </b>help, you <b>will</b> be there <i>to help</i>. It would be a shame for the Prince or your friends to hear about this little... accident, am I right? Good lad&quot;<br /> Aside that, it is ideal to &quot;torture&quot; someone... some mind games, psychological terror... your victim eat... eat ... eat, but the Hunger grows, no matter how much he consume! Always Hungry! Hungrier than usual... it would drive insane anyone, denegerate your victim in to mindless beast, or you even could be his savior again; &quot;I know why the blood of thode mortals don't staisfy your hunger my friend... but I know what will&quot;<br /> Ohh the possibilites of such a simple little power","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","user":"Shadeprowler","date":". 05-10-2023, 11:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T08:45:28-07:00","id":1511226,"title":"","content":"Basically it's a power for a sadistic player!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T08:54:34-07:00","id":1511230,"title":"","content":"In a sense?<br /> Yes<br /> Or a creative one<br /> Having mastery over a Vampire basic , dare I say fundamental &quot;trait&quot;? The Hunger? <br /> Just think about Stephen King's Thinner<br /> Like Tadzu Lempke, places a curse on someone... torture? Punish? Assert dominance by the virtue you have mastery over other's basic need? <br /> As I said, many possibilites - fitting in a personal horror game either if you are the victim and either if you are the &quot;boss with da powa&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}